# LOCAL PYTHON VENVS. Measured: 3,636 of the 4,071 files in the build context
# were .venv-gemini -- 89% of everything Docker had to walk and hash, for a
# directory the image never uses (it installs from requirements.txt). A build
# context is priced in FILES, not megabytes: this is 65MB that took minutes to
# enumerate while transferring 44kB, and it is what made a deploy time out.
